{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06581","headline":"晦日任桥池亭 · 储光羲","name":"晦日任桥池亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"温泉作天邑，直北开新洲。\n未有菰蒲生，即闻凫雁游。\n六亭在高岸，数岛居中流。\n晦日望清波，相与期泛游。\n西道苦转毂，北堤疲行舟。\n清泠水木阴，才可适我忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06581.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06581","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}